---
// DietFoodCards.astro - High-contrast, clean white/gray cards showcasing Denis's BMS Carnivore Diet
---

<div class="diet-cards-container">
	<!-- Category: MEATS (Clean 2x2 Grid) -->
	<div class="diet-category-group">
		<h4 class="diet-category-title">MEATS</h4>
		<div class="diet-cards-grid">
			<!-- Meats (Veal, Beef Steaks & Organs) -->
